+        # [CORRECTNESS] GLM-5.3 / DeepSeek-V3 noaux_tc on MI300A: the aiter
+        # `biased_grouped_topk` kernel runs the router sigmoid + the LARGE
+        # e_score_correction_bias (rms ~7.8) add + top-k in bf16 (gate kept
+        # native bf16, bias cast to gating_output.dtype). That ±0.4% rounding
